## Hard constraints

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **Context7** | Before writing/changing Python or shell that calls third-party libs/APIs: MCP **`user-context7`** → `resolve-library-id` → `query-docs`. Use pins from **`docs/cross-cutting/anchored-toolchain.md`** / `requirements.lock`. Do not rely on training-data API shapes. |
| **Python** | 3.12 in **`.venv`** at repo root; bootstrap **`scripts/bootstrap_venv.sh`**. On this machine prefer **`/opt/homebrew/bin/python3.12`**. |
| **AWS** | **`aws` CLI subprocess only** — no boto3, no AWS SDK packages. Assume CLI installed and authenticated. |
| **ElevenLabs** | REST via **`interview_mux.elevenlabs_rest`** — no ElevenLabs SDK. Canonical spec: **`docs/cross-cutting/elevenlabs-integration-guide.md`**. |
| **Secrets** | Load from **`config/secrets/secrets.env`** — never commit, never hardcode. New keys → **`docs/cross-cutting/config-keys.md`**. |
| **Media** | Default input **`./ASSETS/`** (gitignored). If missing, ask for full path. Runs under **`ASSETS/executions/exec_*`** or legacy **`data/run_*`**. |
| **Prompts** | Load from **`docs/prompts/`**; stage keys must match **`pipeline.py`** / **`stage-registry.md`**. Do not drift copy without updating specs + examples. |
| **Schemas** | Validate stage JSON with **`prompt_validation`** / schemas under **`docs/cross-cutting/json-schemas/`**; gap-fill + GUI Zod — **`docs/cross-cutting/artifact-generation-and-validation.md`**. |
| **Scope** | **Audio + transcript text** only — no video/CV unless product explicitly expands. Optional R&D: **`docs/pipeline/value-analysis/`** — not the default delivery path. |

### What not to build

- SQLite / `mux_store`
- boto3 or preset ladder A–E from old repos
- Parallel operator status channels (see logging below)
- Auto-enabling pre-clean or other **quality offers** (operator must accept)

### New dependencies

Must follow anchor lock policy: **`requirements.lock`**, `pip-audit` in **`tools/check_prerequisites.sh`**, document in **`anchored-toolchain.md`**. See **`docs/roadmap/future-proofing.md`** guardrails.

