## Operator gates (mandatory)

| Gate | When | Action |
|------|------|--------|
| **G0** | After `transcript_review_build` | Operator fixes STT in GUI; complete before `speaker_roles` |
| **G1** | After analysis / `optimal_questions` | If `delivery: record` gaps lack **`vo_pickup/*.wav`**, stop until recorded; then `vo_ingest` |
| **G2** | After G1 clear | Set **`selected_flow`**: `flow1` \| `flow2` \| `flow3` in **`run_meta.json`** before flow pipeline |
| **Profile** | Before Flow 1 `topic_coverage_audit` | **`meta.operator_verified: true`** in **`analysis_state.json`** |

**Quality offers (optional, not gates):** Background noise removal — offered at documented checkpoints; **never auto-run**. Pickup-only scope after G1 recordings. Spec: **`docs/pipeline/audio_preclean/README.md`**, **`docs/cross-cutting/podcast-quality-roadmap.md`**.

Full gate copy: **`docs/workflows/operator-gates.md`**.

