## Pipeline & code conventions

- **Stage orders:** `ANALYSIS_ORDER`, `FLOW1_ORDER`, `FLOW2_ORDER` in **`src/interview_mux/pipeline.py`** — add `FLOW3_ORDER` / `run_flow3` when shipping Flow 3.
- **Idempotency:** Each stage writes **`.stage_done/<stage_id>`**; re-run with **`--from-stage`** per **`docs/workflows/idempotent-runs.md`**.
- **GUI metadata:** New stages → **`web/stages.py`** + **`docs/workflows/gui-surface-map.md`** + **`api-reference.md`**.
- **Orchestrator:** Shared LLM stages may enqueue investigations — **`analysis_orchestrator.py`**; do not bypass memory merge rules in **`docs/cross-cutting/analysis-memory.md`**.
- **Long interviews:** Respect context policy — **`docs/workflows/long-interview-chunking.md`**.
- **NLE:** **`segments/nle_edits.json`** via API; applied in **`full_master_ranking`** input/persist and **`edl_flow1`** (`nle_state.py`).

